WEBVTT

00:06:58.246 --> 00:07:02.246
how can we know
the dancer from the dance?"

00:07:04.579 --> 00:07:06.829
I'd been driving for an hour

00:07:06.871 --> 00:07:10.246
when I looked in my rear view mirror
and saw my own brightening glance.

00:07:10.829 --> 00:07:14.121
The light my eyes had carried
for as long as they had been blue.

00:07:14.163 --> 00:07:16.038
The predispositions and impulses

00:07:16.079 --> 00:07:18.996
that had propelled me as a toddler
to try and slip over a boat

00:07:19.038 --> 00:07:20.163
into a Chicago lake,

00:07:20.204 --> 00:07:21.704
that had propelled me as a teen

00:07:21.746 --> 00:07:24.704
to jump into wild Cape Cod Bay
after a hurricane.

00:07:26.246 --> 00:07:28.454
But I also saw in my reflection

00:07:28.496 --> 00:07:30.246
that, had Abed not injured me,